    "description": "The Libby row once the reader's library is known, so the destination is this exact title inside Libby. The four-character difference from storeBorrowFree is the point: without it the destination would get better and the row would look identical. Deliberately does NOT claim the copy is available \u2014 availability is per-library, and the same title is 87-of-87 at one library and 11-deep in holds at another \u2014 so it names the book and the lender, not the outcome."
